<html lang="fr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Votre Devis - Pavillon Les Lys</title>
    <style>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      body {
        font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        background-color: #0a0a0a;
        color: #f5f5f5;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .email-container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background-color: #1a1a1a;
        border: 1px solid #2d2d2d;
      }
      .header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a0a0a 0%, #1a1a1a 100%);
        padding: 40px 30px;
        text-align: center;
        border-bottom: 2px solid #d4af37;
      }
      .logo {
        font-size: 28px;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #d4af37;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }
      .tagline {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #a0a0a0;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 40px 30px;
      }
      .greeting {
        font-size: 18px;
        color: #d4af37;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
      .intro-text {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #d0d0d0;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        line-height: 1.8;
      }
      .quote-card {
        background-color: #0a0a0a;
        border: 1px solid #2d2d2d;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 25px;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
      }
      .quote-header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        padding-bottom: 15px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #2d2d2d;
      }
      .quote-ref {
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #d4af37;
      }
      .quote-date {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #a0a0a0;
      }
      .items-table {
        width: 100%;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        border-collapse: collapse;
      }
      .items-table th {
        background-color: #2d2d2d;
        color: #d4af37;
        padding: 12px;
        text-align: left;
        font-size: 12px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
      }
      .items-table td {
        padding: 12px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #2d2d2d;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #d0d0d0;
      }
      .items-table tr:last-child td {
        border-bottom: none;
      }
      .total-section {
        background-color: #1a1a1a;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        margin-top: 20px;
      }
      .total-row {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 8px 0;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #d0d0d0;
      }
      .total-row.final {
        border-top: 2px solid #d4af37;
        margin-top: 10px;
        padding-top: 15px;
        font-size: 18px;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #d4af37;
      }
      .notes-section {
        background-color: #2d2d2d;
        border-left: 3px solid #d4af37;
        padding: 15px;
        margin-top: 25px;
        border-radius: 4px;
      }
      .notes-title {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #d4af37;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }
      .notes-text {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #c0c0c0;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .cta-button {
        display: inline-block;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d4af37 0%, #b5952f 100%);
        color: #0a0a0a;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 15px 40px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-weight: bold;
        font-size: 14px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
        margin: 30px 0;
        transition: transform 0.2s;
      }
      .cta-button:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }
      .footer {
        background-color: #0a0a0a;
        padding: 30px;
        text-align: center;
        border-top: 1px solid #2d2d2d;
      }
      .footer-text {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #808080;
        line-height: 1.8;
      }
      .footer-link {
        color: #d4af37;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .social-links {
        margin-top: 20px;
      }
      .social-links a {
        display: inline-block;
        margin: 0 10px;
        color: #d4af37;
        font-size: 20px;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
        .content {
          padding: 20px;
        }
        .quote-header {
          flex-direction: column;
          align-items: flex-start;
        }
        .quote-date {
          margin-top: 5px;
        }
        .items-table th,
        .items-table td {
          padding: 8px;
          font-size: 12px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="email-container">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="header">
        <div class="logo">PAVILLON LES LYS</div>
        <div class="tagline">Espace de Réception Haut de Gamme</div>
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="content">
        <div class="greeting">Bonjour {{firstName}} {{lastName}},</div>

        <p class="intro-text">
          Nous avons le plaisir de vous transmettre votre devis personnalisé
          pour votre événement au Pavillon Les Lys. Notre équipe se tient à
          votre disposition pour toute question ou ajustement.
        </p>

        <!-- Quote Card -->
        <div class="quote-card">
          <div class="quote-header">
            <div class="quote-ref">Devis N° {{quote.reference}}</div>
            <div class="quote-date">{{quote.date}}</div>
          </div>

          <!-- Items Table -->
          <table class="items-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Description</th>
                <th style="text-align: right;">Quantité</th>
                <th style="text-align: right;">Prix Unit.</th>
                <th style="text-align: right;">Total</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {{#each quote.items}}
                <tr>
                  <td>{{this.description}}</td>
                  <td style="text-align: right;">{{this.quantity}}</td>
                  <td style="text-align: right;">{{this.unitPrice}} €</td>
                  <td style="text-align: right;">{{this.totalPrice}} €</td>
                </tr>
              {{/each}}
            </tbody>
          </table>

          <!-- Total Section -->
          <div class="total-section">
            <div class="total-row">
              <span>Total HT</span>
              <span>{{quote.totalHT}} €</span>
            </div>
            <div class="total-row">
              <span>TVA ({{quote.tva}}%)</span>
              <span>{{quote.tvaAmount}} €</span>
            </div>
            <div class="total-row final">
              <span>Total TTC</span>
              <span>{{quote.totalTTC}} €</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Notes Section -->
          {{#if quote.notes}}
            <div class="notes-section">
              <div class="notes-title">Notes & Conditions</div>
              <div class="notes-text">{{quote.notes}}</div>
            </div>
          {{/if}}
        </div>

        <!-- CTA Button -->
        <center>
          <a href="{{downloadUrl}}" class="cta-button">
            📥 Télécharger le Devis PDF
          </a>
        </center>

        <p class="intro-text" style="margin-top: 30px;">
          Ce devis est valable 30 jours à compter de sa date d'émission. Pour
          confirmer votre réservation, un acompte de 30% du montant total est
          requis.<br /><br />
          Nous restons à votre entière disposition pour toute information
          complémentaire.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <div class="footer">
        <p class="footer-text">
          <strong style="color: #D4AF37;">Pavillon Les Lys</strong><br />
          Espace de Réception Haut de Gamme<br />
          📍 [Adresse] • 📞 [Téléphone]<br />
          <a
            href="mailto:contact@pavillon-les-lys.fr"
            class="footer-link"
          >contact@pavillon-les-lys.fr</a>
        </p>

        <div class="social-links">
          <a href="#">📘</a>
          <a href="#">📷</a>
          <a href="#">🐦</a>
        </div>

        <p class="footer-text" style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 11px;">
          © 2026 Pavillon Les Lys. Tous droits réservés.<br />
          Vous recevez cet email car vous avez demandé un devis sur notre
          plateforme.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>